cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the accompanying article."
title: regimebench
abstract: >-
  A controlled benchmark for regime-count selection on financial time series,
  testing Silhouette, Davies-Bouldin, Calinski-Harabasz, AIC, BIC, BIC(N_eff),
  ICL, the Gap Statistic and Prediction Strength against known ground truth,
  four null controls, two positive controls, and a century of US daily returns.
type: software
version: 1.0.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/thefledgedhurricane/regimebench"
keywords:
  - unsupervised learning
  - cluster validity
  - model selection
  - benchmarking
  - reproducibility
  - time-series clustering
  - regime detection
